    "answer": "Ex-Partner, Former Partner",
    "mnemonic": "Your <kanji>origin</kanji> partner is a partner you had originally, but don't have anymore. In other words, this is your <vocabulary>ex-partner</vocabulary> or <vocabulary>former partner</vocabulary>.\n\nLike in English, this word is fairly formal, and it covers any kind of ex-partner, including business and romantic partners.",
